    {
      "id": "claim_d5649e2cb0324d909ec4fb82dadc1c3a",
      "statement": "medical_lookup is a return_direct tool that delegates to relay_question(), which invokes a fully compiled healthcare_rag child graph (module-level `child`, compiled with checkpointer=True) using the caller's own RunnableConfig by default, so healthcare conversation history and refusal boundaries persist inside the coach thread under the tool's checkpoint namespace.",
