    },
    {
      "id": "claim_fc03973707124ce3ba46d4de762e9bac",
      "statement": "relay_question()'s _assemble step prefixes a validated answer with a fixed monograph introduction (and PHI notice/follow-up bullets when present), returns a healthcare-child safety short circuit answer completely unchanged with no framing or follow-ups, and converts any child error, missing answer, or raised exception into a fixed retrieval-failure message rather than exposing internal error detail.",
