    {
      "id": "claim_fe3d794526954230a40a9ca0adde01e5",
      "statement": "Setting HC_RAG_RELAY_MODE=pipeline makes relay_question() compile a brand-new healthcare_rag graph with a fresh InMemorySaver and a new UUID thread for every single lookup, preserving the child's safety and validation stages but discarding cross-turn medical memory; this mode is a deliberate continuity trade-off, not a safety bypass.",
