    {
      "id": "claim_0d6bcc15e4264fd6a8eca75534a8aa35",
      "statement": "compose_ui is only an acknowledgement tool call; the actual enforcement point is validate_composition(), invoked before model output enters state, which accepts only a closed catalog of components and each component's exact allow-listed fact-bearing and static prop names.",
