    {
      "id": "claim_1f5d31b0782d46f6b2738e03df3ab067",
      "statement": "On the first invalid compose_ui composition in an agent run, SafeModelResponseMiddleware rewrites the offending tool call to an empty tree and returns an error ToolMessage so the model can retry or answer in plain text; a second invalid cycle in the same run instead forces a terminal SAFE_FALLBACK AIMessage with no tool calls.",
