      "id": "claim_d3593f70391b41529fd418ee60138e96",
      "statement": "CoachEngine (evals/coach_engine.py) builds the real coach graph topology with an InMemorySaver and InMemoryStore, monkeypatches coach_build.coach_agent to an offline Route B agent only during graph construction, and drives graph turns to assert routing, healthcare-child lineage via checkpoint records, document/reminder handling, and catalog reference resolution without a deployed service or live model.",
