      "statement": "The make eval-agent and make eval-agent-multiturn offline evaluations exercise the coach/healthcare-graph boundary using deterministic in-process fakes (fake gateway, search, and checkpoint inspection) and in-memory persistence; they are behavioral regression gates, not certification of a live deployment, and must be paired with focused unit tests and deployment/perimeter testing for changes to real credentials, persistence, or HTTP integration.",
